  205  *  @discussion Identical to thread_call_allocate, except that priority
  206  *  and options are specified by caller.
  207  *  @param func Callback to invoke when thread call is scheduled.
  208  *  @param param0 First argument to pass to callback.
  209  *  @param pri Priority of item.
